opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Time-bounded computations and stream iteration"
description:
  "Eventually provides composable computations that run against an explicit logical time budget. It also provides writer and reader interfaces for processing finite or infinite streams, with each step consuming one unit of the available budget."
